=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play logs/alpine323 ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Logs screen (pkg/screens/logs), inferred$
# from v0.3.2 and origin/main, read from a simulated host by the$
# real reader (pkg/engine/logview). It only reads: no plan, no$
# y/N, no journal. No pager runs: Open says what hardn would$
# run. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and file$
# is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/alpine323$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23, whose less is a link to$
# BusyBox (vm-runs/s1/01-tools.log). LESSSECURE=1 changes$
# nothing there: s still prompts Log file, E and :e Examine$
# (vm-runs/s1/04-less2-alpine323-vm.log). No path was typed at$
# s, so its write did not run; E did try a name that does not$
# exist. That s writes and E opens any path as root is read$
# (miscutils/less.c, master). It refuses less --version, so it$
# has no Open item (decision 7 (a)). With Alpine's less package$
# there is one [I, not run].$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 601 bytes$
$
  Last 4 of 10 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:04 WARNING: hardn's boot unit was not$
      | removed: exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 641 bytes$
$
  Last 4 of 11 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
      2026/10/20 12:01:00 INFO: run 2: exit 0$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

